  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: Hello! We hope you are all doing well. We recently started a dog supply company that manufactures leather dog collars and leashes and then takes a part of the profits and donates it towards the training of service dogs for veterans.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">All of our leather collars and leashes are manufactured right here in the United States. We also have the ability to customize the products with your dogs name that can be laser engraved into the leather.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The USP for our product is the fact that it is all made here in the USA and that we are looking to provide 5 Service dogs for veterans in the next three years and the only way we can do that is if with your help.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">As for payment terms, for every leash or collar that is sold through your unique code we will pay $5 per item sold and will be paid out on a bi-weekly basis.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We are really looking forward towards growing this business together with you!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>",
